"updated_at":"2026-07-14T17:06:48Z","closed_at":"2026-07-14T17:02:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121013","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121013.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121013.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-14T17:02:13Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117080#issuecomment-4894319802.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nGDScript doesn't handle compatibility methods for virtuals, which means that the change adding an extra argument to `EditorDock._update_layout()` broke plugins that relied on the original single-argument version.\r\n\r\nThis PR creates a new virtual called `_update_layout_and_slot()`, which contains both arguments, while also removing the extra one in `_update_layout()` and marking it as deprecated.\r\n\r\nAnother way of solving this would be to add virtual compatibility support to GDScript, but that's an area I almost never touched, so I would rather leave that to someone else (which I would eternally thank if they did! :slightly_smiling_face:).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121013/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121013/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}